plc/missouri/audrain-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value saw January to February at 31% and August to September at 36% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 158% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value.</p>"}
